WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.029
This is Narrative Monitor, from Dealer Revenue Group.

00:00:03.631 --> 00:00:07.684
Your customers now ask ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude, Perplexity,

00:00:07.684 --> 00:00:10.569
Grok and Google's AI Mode who to buy from.

00:00:10.569 --> 00:00:15.789
Narrative Monitor asks them the questions your customers ask, on a schedule,

00:00:15.789 --> 00:00:18.330
and shows you exactly what they said.

00:00:18.935 --> 00:00:20.401
Setup takes a few minutes:

00:00:20.401 --> 00:00:24.402
your business, your market, the topics that matter, your own questions,

00:00:24.402 --> 00:00:26.487
and the competitors you want watched.

00:00:28.455 --> 00:00:30.625
Every month you get a full report.

00:00:30.625 --> 00:00:32.922
It opens with your visibility score:

00:00:32.922 --> 00:00:35.602
how often AI names you when customers ask.

00:00:36.205 --> 00:00:41.487
Then it breaks that down by what shoppers actually want, like lease deals, financing,

00:00:41.487 --> 00:00:46.210
or a brake job, so you can see exactly where AI sends buyers somewhere else.

00:00:46.811 --> 00:00:52.318
On the service side, it shows the independent shops AI recommends instead of your service

00:00:52.318 --> 00:00:52.998
department.

00:00:53.605 --> 00:00:58.206
You see the actual words each assistant used about you, so you know where it's right,

00:00:58.206 --> 00:01:00.154
and where it's wrong or out of date.

00:01:00.756 --> 00:01:04.808
Then a ranked list of what to fix first, based on your own results,

00:01:04.808 --> 00:01:09.524
plus content ideas you can hand to whoever runs your website and social media.

00:01:10.125 --> 00:01:10.879
Further down:

00:01:10.879 --> 00:01:15.864
your score trended over time, and your Google reviews compared with each competitor's.

00:01:16.465 --> 00:01:21.745
Plus the sites AI draws on when it talks about you, and how it describes each competitor,

00:01:21.745 --> 00:01:23.761
with a threat rating for each one.

00:01:24.364 --> 00:01:27.572
On Pro, a short check-in also arrives every week:

00:01:27.572 --> 00:01:33.004
your score versus last week, the questions you gained or lost, and the top actions.

00:01:33.605 --> 00:01:36.989
Standard is two hundred ninety-nine dollars a month:

00:01:36.989 --> 00:01:39.331
four AI assistants, every two weeks.

00:01:39.331 --> 00:01:40.958
Pro is three ninety-nine:

00:01:40.958 --> 00:01:43.952
all six, every week, with the deeper analysis.

00:01:50.779 --> 00:01:54.206
New customers get a special offer for a limited time.

00:01:54.206 --> 00:01:58.926
See the details on our website, or start with a free AI Visibility Audit,

00:01:58.926 --> 00:02:01.318
and see what AI says about you today.
